# rc1 (2026-10-27): APS5_RESOURCE_CACHE_ENTRIES=4096 instead of 1024 (el13: 5.3k resource-cache misses and ~4.8k
# evictions per 10 s with 1024 entries, each miss a 183 us build on the committer), full game, alternating with
# deferred stores; compare with el15/el16 base (18.0-19.3 presents per 10 s).
measure 60
base-1 75
ds-1 75 deferstores on
base-2 75
ds-2 75 deferstores on
base-3 75
ds-3 75 deferstores on
